# CONFLUENCE READ — MCP THEN REST [CRITICAL]

## Rule CONFLUENCE.1

Prefer Confluence MCP. After retries, use:

- `config/scripts/get-confluence-page-rest.ps1`
- `config/scripts/search-confluence-rest.ps1`
- Credentials: `CONFLUENCE_URL` / `CONFLUENCE_WIKI_BASE` plus email/token (or Jira email/token)
- Disclose: `Confluence source: REST fallback …`

Confluence writes remain forbidden (Rule 1a).
